-- GAME ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  Title       Winter Sports
  Publisher   Electric Dreams Software, 1985
  Version     1.0

-- YOU NEED ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Your own copy of the original game, saved beside this patch:

  File        Winter Sports (1985)(Electric Dreams Software).tap
  MD5         a53ffe203db7109427c84fb438aa9ebe

  The patch carries none of the game's code. It only works with that exact
  dump, under that name or any other: anything else is refused, with a
  message naming the file it wants.

-- WHAT IT DOES --------------------------------------------------------------
  Moving figures become Next hardware sprites, so they keep their own colours
  and no longer take on the scenery's (colour clash). Game logic is unchanged.

  Colours     Default (the game's own) plus: Enhanced, chosen on the menu, off
              by default.
  Enhanced    Downhill: painted extended-colour mountain panorama (the other
              events keep the original 16 colours). A painted set, colourist
              not named.

  Pace        original

  Changes     1.0: first NXC patch, from nexclash winter_sports with no
              loading-screen hold

  Note        Six events in one game: the patch rebuilds all of them.
              Smoother, similar play in the game's own 16 colours: Downhill
              scrolls on Layer 2 and every event draws at 28 MHz from the
              frame interrupt (no tearing). Toggle Original pace restores the
              original timing. Ski Jumping is unchanged. The tape's loading
              screen shows from ENTER.

-- MENU ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   1  Your clock stops
   2  Missed gates count
   3  Endless stamina

  No POKEs were published for this game, so these were found by tracing it:
  Your clock stops (Downhill, Slalom, Giant Slalom and Speed Skating), Missed
  gates count (the three skiing events), Endless stamina (Biathlon). Each was
  checked in the simulator; they work with the colour clash fix on.

